nce to reset her Skill cooldown when it damages enemies, enabling extra Swirls."},{"name":"Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","text":"Provides a powerful 48% ATK boost to the next character switched in, making Sucrose an excellent F2P buffer for ATK-scaling DPS teams."},{"name":"Hakushin Ring","text":"Provides Energy Recharge and grants an Elemental DMG Bonus to elements involved when Sucrose triggers an Electro reaction."},{"name":"Magic Guide","text":"Provides Elemental Mastery and increases damage against enemies affected by Hydro or Electro. A budget Swirl option."},{"name":"Favonius Codex","text":"Energy Recharge and team particles on CRIT; build enough CRIT Rate for reliable triggers."}],"a":[{"names":["Viridescent Venerer"],"text":"Sucrose's best artifact set, increasing Swirl damage by 60% and reducing enemies' RES to the element Swirled by 40%. Essential for reaction-focused teams.","stats":"EM · EM · EM"},{"names":["Instructor"],"text":"Provides Elemental Mastery and boosts the entire team's EM after triggering an elemental reaction. A solid F2P option for reaction-focused teams.","stats":"EM · EM · EM"},{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"Boosts the team's ATK by 20% after Sucrose uses her Elemental Burst. A situational support option for ATK-scaling DPS teams.","stats":"EM · EM · EM"}],"t":[{"name":"Lunar-Charged Team #1","members":["Sucrose","Xingqiu","Fischl","Ineffa"],"text":"Sucrose drives Swirls while Xingqiu applies Hydro and Fischl supplies Electro. Ineffa adds Electro support and helps enable Lunar-Charged damage.","roles":["On-field Driver","Off-field DPS / Hydro Enabler","Off-field DPS / Battery","Off-field DPS / Shielder"]},{"name":"Vaporization Team","members":["Sucrose","Klee","Furina","Bennett"],"text":"Sucrose groups enemies and shreds Pyro RES while Klee delivers explosive damage. Furina provides Hydro application and a powerful damage buff, while Bennett boosts ATK and provides healing.","roles":["EM Buffer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Off-field DPS / Buffer","Healer / Buffer"]},{"name":"Pyro Case Files","members":["Sucrose","Arlecchino","Nicole","Mona"],"text":"Sucrose provides grouping, EM sharing, and RES Shred while Nicole buffs the team and Mona boosts burst damage. Arlecchino leads with powerful Pyro damage, with Mona adding Hydro application for Vaporize opportunities.","roles":["EM Buffer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Shielder / Buffer","Buffer / Hydro Enabler"]},{"name":"Aggravate Academy","members":["Sucrose","Keqing","Nahida","Fischl"],"text":"Sucrose provides Electro RES Shred and EM sharing while Keqing and Fischl trigger powerful Aggravate damage. Nahida supplies consistent Dendro application to keep reactions flowing.","roles":["EM Buffer / Debuffer","On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS / Battery"]}],"v":"Reaction EM Support: Share EM and reduce enemy resistance with Viridescent Venerer.\nBudget ATK Buffer: Use a three-star weapon and Instructor for accessible buffs.","n":2},"seo":{"roles":["EM Build"],"about":"Anemo support who groups enemies, shares EM, and boosts reaction damage.","pros":["Excellent EM sharing.","Strong enemy grouping.","F2P-friendly support."],"cons":["Limited against heavy enemies.","Energy-hungry Burst.","Low personal damage."],"weapons":["A Thousand Floating Dreams","Sunny Morning Sleep-In","Sacrificial Fragments","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Hakushin Ring","Magic Guide","Favonius Codex"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Best Support"},{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"},{"sets":["Noblesse Oblige"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Support"}],"main":["Elemental Mastery","Elemental Mastery","Elemental Mastery"],"stats":["Elemental Mastery: 800+","Energy Recharge: 130% ~ 160%"],"vars":[{"title":"Reaction EM Support","role":"Support / Driver","weapons":["Sacrificial Fragments","Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Magic Guide"],"arts":[{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Stack EM; add ER as needed.","teams":"Swirlable elements and strong off-field damage.","when":"Share EM and reduce enemy resistance with Viridescent Venerer.","cond":"Swirl does not CRIT in its usual form.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Budget ATK Buffer","role":"Support","weapons":["Thrilling Tales of Dragon Slayers","Magic Guide"],"arts":[{"sets":["Instructor"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Viridescent Venerer"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"ER and EM as appropriate.","teams":"ATK-scaling carry; swap directly after TTDS.","when":"Use a three-star weapon and Instructor for accessible buffs.","cond":"TTDS swap order is essential.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vayuda Turquoise Sliver","Vayuda Turquoise Fragment","Vayuda Turquoise Chunk","Vayuda Turquoise Gemstone","Hurricane Seed","Teachings of Freedom","Guide to Freedom","Philosophies of Freedom","Whopperflower Nectar","Shimmering Nectar","Energy Nectar","Windwheel Aster","Spirit Locket of Boreas","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Normal Attack","pri":"Level 1+"},{"name":"Elemental Skill","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Elemental Burst","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"Lunar-Charged Team #1","members":["Sucrose","Xingqiu","Fischl","Ineffa"]},{"name":"Vaporization Team","members":["Sucrose","Klee","Furina","Bennett"]},{"name":"Pyro Case Files","members":["Sucrose","Arlecchino","Nicole","Mona"]},{"name":"Aggravate Academy","members":["Sucrose","Keqing","Nahida","Fischl"]}]}}],"title":"Sucrose","el":"Anemo"}